  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to finance for horticulture farmers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim is to improve access to finance for horticulture smallholder farmers, in particular youth and women. The purpose of this study is to gain better insights in barriers for access to finance in the horticulture sector in Uganda, to map and analyse the system around (lack of) access to finance for horticulture smallholder farmers and identify the leverage points that should be addressed to have most impact for improving access to finance for horticulture smallholder farmers in Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
